NOTE_EN = "Level: undergraduate (year 3). Made from the lecture lec05-kp11 with view-from-text-v3: pages were planned first and each page is mainly one native infographic (designed in HTML and converted to native nodes), with the terms defined on the same page. 11 pages; every number is computed by program. The scatter on page 8 is redrawn from the source's setup with the fixed seed 20261025 and is not the source's original sample; 480 to 25, the momentum parameters and the boundary change are the source's report and were not rerun."
